er 240D for ultra-portability. The guide explains that capacity determines runtime, output determines which devices can run, and solar, UPS, surge capability, ports, size, and weight are important considerations. Buyers should estimate total energy needs and add a 20\u201330% buffer. Power stations are quieter and cleaner than fuel generators but have limited capacity. Most last five to ten years, depending on battery chemistry, usage, storage, and temperature.","ref_id":{"turn_index":641327,"ref_type":"news","ref_index":13},"pub_date":1791913524.0,"result_type":"news","thumbnail_url":"https://images.openai.com/static-rsc-1/o3QPmhOPJDwNCpQvt0acjmEV5nt1iCMUWxiy-GsJq1h40u6VT21JgK0PNs4lZA4Ki3uLb2t9KxM-6CNtR3cdNc-I1fmG073r-Kk3eT5bIt_9nheqjvY1pQ62znAzDtzH","attribution":"www.techradar.com"}]}],"source_message_ids":["353fb9c0-b461-4d2e-8be2-ebec54b44ae7","a11fed97-c60b-4a84-b3ef-690329cbfb71","1d4ebbd4-dd7f-4941-acac-9e075219918d"]},"reasoning_status":"is_reasoning","tool_summary_type":"web","tool_icons":["https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=voltandvalley.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=thewattlist.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=smartenergyedge.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=ecosolarkits.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.wired.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=outagereadyhq.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=campequipmentplus.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=quiettechreport.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=powersized.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.outdoorgearlab.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.practicalbuyerguide.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=poweredportable.github.io&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.goodhousekeeping.com&sz=128","https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.techradar.com