ct/1943727-REG/jackery_60_060010_us00146_explorer_600_v2_portable.html?BI=23971&kw=JAE600V2SS1A&utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn641327product2\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**Best high-output value**\n\n\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn641327product2\",\"Anker SOLIX C1000 Gen 2 Portable Power Station with 100W Bif\u2026\"]\ue201\n\n## \\$709.99\n\n1,024Wh battery \u00b7 2,000W AC output \u00b7 100W solar panel\n\nB&amp;H Photo \u00b7 Suitable for camping appliances and larger loads, though a 100W panel recharges slowly.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View kit\ue202https://www.bhphotovideo.com/c/product/1986925-REG/anker_b17631a9_solix_c1000_gen_2.html?BI=23971&kw=ANSC1KG21WBF&utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn641327product4\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**Best balanced 1kWh kit**\n\n\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn641327product4\",\"EcoFlow Delta 3 Classic 1800/3600W 1kWh LFP Battery Portable\u2026\"]\ue201\n\n## \\$649.00\n\n1,024Wh battery \u00b7 1,800W AC output \u00b7 160W solar panel\n\nHome Depot \u00b7 Good balance of battery size, solar charging and output.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View kit\ue202https://www.homedepot.com/p/EcoFlow-Delta-3-Classic-1800-3600W-1kWh-LFP-Battery-Portable-Power-Station-w-160w-Solar-Panel-For-Home-Backup-Camping-RVs-EFD3C-160WSP-N/343454955?fp=oai&utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn641327product17\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**Best for longer off-grid trips**\n\n\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn641327product17\",\"EcoFlow - DELTA 3 Portable Power Station with 2*220W Solar P\u2026\"]\ue201\n\n## \\$999.00\n\n1,024Wh battery \u00b7 1,800W AC output \u00b7 two 220W solar panels\n\nBest Buy \u00b7 More solar capacity for replenishing the battery during extended camping.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View kit\ue202https://www.bestbuy.com/product/ecoflow-delta-3-portable-power-station-with-2220w-solar-panel1800-ac-output-500w-solar-inputsolar-generator-for-home-use-1024-wh-capacity-light-gray/JJGTTGF54T/sku/13160793?utm_medium=feed&fs=toftho&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\nPrices shown are retailer listings found in the search and may change. Confirm that the selected package includes the solar panels and cables.\n\n## Which size do you need?\n\n| Camping use | Battery capacity | Suggested solar panel |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| Phones, lights, small fan | 250\u2013500Wh | 100W |\n| Laptop, fan, weekend camping | 500\u2013800Wh | 100\u2013200W |\n| Electric cooler, multiple devices | 1,000\u20131,500Wh | 200\u2013400W |\n| Longer off-grid trips, higher consumption | 2,000Wh+ | 400W+ |\n\nFor typical car camping, I'd start with the **EcoFlow DELTA 3 Classic + 160W panel** or **Anker SOLIX C1000 Gen 2 + 100W panel**\\. Both provide approximately 1kWh"}]}  

